u001b[78Ga\u001b[80GSynthefy\u001b[89GAPI\u001b[93Gkey.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mWhere is the data?\u001b[25G\u001b[22mPostgreSQL\u001b[36G(including\u001b[47GAWS\u001b[51GRDS\u001b[55Gor\u001b[58GAurora),\u001b[67GSnowflake,\u001b[78GDatabricks,\u001b[90Gor\u001b[93Gexported\u001b[102Gfiles\u001b[108G(CSV,\u001b[114GExcel,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GParquet, JSON).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B- For a datab\u001b[20Gse,\u001b[24Gcan y\u001b[30Gu\u001b[32Gset up a \u001b[1mread-only\u001b[22m login and store i\u001b[70Gin an environment\u001b[88Gvariable\u001b[97G(e.g.\u001b[103G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDATABASE_URL\u001b[39m)\u001b[117Gor\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8Gan AWS secr\u001b[20Gt? Please\u001b[30Gdon't\u001b[36Gpaste\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gpassword here. I only need\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gvariable's\u001b[88Gname.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mUp to what date is the data complete?\u001b[22m For example, \"orders are\u001b[69Gfully loaded through 2026-10-25.\"\u001b[103GNori-Rel\u001b[112Gcan't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gwork this out from\u001b[25Gthe newest\u001b[36Grow, so you need to tell me.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Gyou'd\u001b[12Glike to try\u001b[24Git before connecting your own dat\u001b[58G, I can run\u001b[70Gthe whole thing on Nori-R\u001b[96Gl's built-in sample\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdatab\u001b[9Gse (48 customers \u001b[27Gnd\u001b[30Gtheir\u001b[36Gorders) in \u001b[48G local\u001b[55GDocker P\u001b[64Gstgres.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 18s · done 5:58 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mI want to know how much each user will spend in the next 30 days. The data is in PostgreSQL: the connection URL is in\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthe DATABASE_URL environment variable, schema nori_rel_example, tables users and orders. The data